text: |-
  THE TIMELINE THEY DON'T
  WANT YOU TO KNOW
  * CHARLIE KIRK IS HIS OWN STAR WITNESS.
  1 FACT: Last August, Charlie Kirk was on private record
  actively telling people that the blue&white country would
  off him if he ever turned on it.
  2
  FACT: About a week later, also last August, Charlie Kirk
  was on public record declaring that agents of the
  pro-blue&white country were bullying him & trying to
  morally blackmail him.
  3
  FACT: Roughly a couple weeks after that, the day before
  he was offed, Charlie Kirk explicitly declared--to direct-
  connect agents of the blue&white country--that he was
  leaving the pro-blue&white cause.
  4
  FACT: That same day, these blue&white agents then
  ZOOm
  held a Zoom call with Charlie.
  5
  6
  7
  8
  FACT: That evening, Charlie messaged multiple people
  "They're going to k*ll me."
  FACT: Charlie Kirk had trouble sleeping that night.
  (I wonder why?)
  FACT: For weeks, those same blue&white agents obscured
  & omitted (some would say "LIED") about Charlie saying
  he was leaving the pro-blue&white cause, and reinforced
  the idea that he was NOT leaving the pro-blue&white cause.
  FACT: Before then, and ever since, the same people from
  the blue&white country have also relentlessly attacked
  Tucker Carlson and Candace Owens--two people whom
  Charlie was already deliberately giving his platform to
  (Tucker) or saying he was going to re-platform (Candace).
  CHARLIE KIRK IS
  HIS OWN STAR WITNESS.
  @BasedSamParker
  @SamParkerSenate
